window.products.push({"id":448072,"name":"Handupfree Electric Can Opener, Restaurant Can Opener, Smooth Edge Automatic Electric Can Opener! Senior with Arthritis, Best Gift for Women","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/7170zpRbpNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Electric can opener, one-button start operation, safe to use and no sharp edges, the best kitchen gadgets and gifts for the elderly and arthritis, hands-free can opener   ☀Specifications: Size: 6.69 x 2.83 x 2.05 inches Weight: 6.7 ounces   ☀Operation method: 1. Place the can opener on the top of the can with its edge in the groove between the cutter and the drive wheel 2. Place the can on a flat surface, press and hold the button for about one second and then release, the can opener will start to cut the sides of the can 3. After the cutting is completed, immediately press the button to reverse the cutter 4. Make sure that the cutter is reset to the starting position and the motor stops. Then, remove the can opener from the can   ☀How to open the battery back cover: 1. Point the back of the can opener to someone and hold the can opener with both hands 2. Two thumbs side by side on the back of the can opener 3. Slide your thumb down hard 4. Open the battery cover and insert the battery.   ☀Warm tips: 1. If the battery is exhausted, the can may not be released by pressing the button. Slide the battery cover back and replace the 2 AA batteries. The can opener should continue to cut. Remember to replace the battery. 2. Jars with heavy seams and uneven edges may stop the can opener. If this happens, follow the procedure above to release the canister. 3. If the can is stuck, press the black button at the end of the can opener. Rotate it in the opposite direction to release the can.   ☀Package contains: 1* Electric can opener 1* Electric can opener instruction manual","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/7170zpRbpNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Handupfree","source_asin":"B09RZVGH48","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-448072","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09RZVGH48","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09RZVGH48","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
