window.products.push({"id":448078,"name":"keepcute Custom Shower Curtain with Hooks Waterproof, Add Your Own Designs Photo Here, Customize Your own Image Shower Curtain 59X65 inch,Machine Wash","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71FtZ2h5O1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Personalized shower curtain: Every part of your home should reflect you and your personality. Use a custom shower curtain to show off. This bathroom curtain can customize your personalized photos according to your creativity, such as your family photos, cute pet/dog/cat photos or any other interesting photos. High-quality material: This bathroom shower curtain is made of polyester waterproof fabric, which is durable. The shower curtain is waterproof and quick-drying, has a firm and smooth texture, and promotes the formation of water droplets. And the fabric shower curtain has the characteristics of high density, resistance to penetration, and good drape. Easy to install and maintain: The button hole on the top of the personalized shower curtain is reinforced to ensure durability and easy installation. This DIY shower curtain is suitable for machine washing in cold water of the same color, drying at low temperature, and not bleachable. Shower curtain printing: This picture shower curtain uses a personalized photo design to create your own unique and interesting shower curtain. This photo shower curtain uses professional high-definition printing technology to make this photo shower curtain clear, colorful, vibrant, strong color fastness, and high scratch resistance. Create your own: 1. Choose a size 2. Click \"Customize Now\" 3. Upload your photo. Note: High resolution images (at least 2000 x 2000 pixels at 72 dpi). If you have any questions about custom shower curtains in the bathroom or have any other ideas or any trouble in the future, please feel free to contact us and we will get back to you within 24 hours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71FtZ2h5O1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"keepcute","source_asin":"B09YCVKKNH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-448078","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09YCVKKNH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09YCVKKNH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":448079,"name":"Sheffield Home Protective Decorative Paper Placemats (40 Count) (Dots)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81qXv4ieFzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Decorate your table top with this set of 40 bistro inspired paper placements from Sheffield Home. The Sheffield Home Protective Decorative Paper Placemats are designed to protect and decorate any table top at any meal. This set of paper placemats includes a stack of 40 peel off mats printed with food safe ink and decorated with a bistro inspired multi-colored dots design. With a look that you may find in a casual corner bistro, the elegant design adds a distinctive touch to any tabletop and helps to sets the stage for a delicious meal. The disposable paper design makes for super easy clean up and you won’t have to spend the time laundering and ironing these mats as you would with cotton placemats. They can be peeled off the stack to set your table with ease and simply tossed away when the meal is over. These paper mats not only add a stylish touch to your table top, but help to protect the wood or the finish of your dining table from water stains, scratches, and heat that can radiate from the bottom of a warm plate. These paper placemats are versatile, stylish, and effective and can be used in any casual kitchen, in a laidback restaurant or coffee shop, or at any relaxed family meal. Paper placemats are ideal for families with kids, as the kids can draw or write on them before or after a meal is served. Unlike traditional vinyl, cork, or cotton placemats, there is no need to worry about food spilling and staining them or heavy plates making indentations that can’t be removed. They provide a carefree and effortless way to protect and cover a tabletop during any service of breakfast, lunch, dinner, or dessert. The slim shape of the full stack of mats makes it easy to slip into any kitchen drawer, place in any pantry bin, or stack on any kitchen shelf.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81qXv4ieFzL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sheffield Home","source_asin":"B00MG1HG76","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-448079","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00MG1HG76","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00MG1HG76","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
