window.products.push({"id":448131,"name":"Harbor House Cozy Cotton Comforter Set - Classic Modern Design, All Season Down Alternative Casual Bedding, Matching Shams, Stella, Paisley Blue Cal K","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91hnonHFDOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Harbor House Stella 6 Piece Cotton Comforter Set can give your bedroom a classic look with a modern touch. A beautiful biege paisley design lays on top of a blue background in different shades giving the overall bed almost a distress look. The 2 matching shams pair beautifully with the comforter and the 2 decorative pillows, 1 oblong and 1 square, add complementary touches. A solid blue bed skirt provides a clean finish to round out the timeless appeal of this cotton comforter set. This bedding set is also OEKO-TEX certified, meaning it does not contain any harmful substances or chemicals, ensuring quality comfort and wellness. This bedding set may come in rolled or compressed packing and will need to be fluffed up. Use a steam iron to help remove wrinkles easier.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91hnonHFDOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Harbor House","source_asin":"B08L7N25ZK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-448131","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08L7N25ZK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08L7N25ZK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":448132,"name":"SOTOGO 15 Pieces Confetti Balloons 18 Inches Large Balloons with Golden, Light Pink and White Paper Confetti Dots for Party Decorations Wedding Decora","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/7188ubfkFpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Function:confetti balloons can meet your needs for party wedding decorations. You can also use them proposal to your lover Size:uninflated ballon is 20 cm long and 10 cm wide, the inflatable diameter is approx. 45 cm/ 18 inches, confetti is 2.5 cm in diameter Quantity:15 pieces confetti balloons can meet your quantities need Wide applications: this set of confetti balloons can be applied in many different situations, such as festival party,anniversary party, birthday party and so on Note: balloons and confetti are together,so you don't have to put the confetti in balloons,shake confetti balloons or rub on carpeted surface to let confetti cling to the sides","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/7188ubfkFpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SOTOGO","source_asin":"B0796L6C3D","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-448132","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0796L6C3D","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0796L6C3D","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":448133,"name":"NIKA SEEDS - Vegetable Cucamelon (Cross Cucumber and Melon) Vine - 20 Seeds","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":7.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61U6nNDSTPL._AC_.jpg","description":"CUCAMELON VINE Cucamelon is a unique heirloom plant, with no cultivars or hybrids developed. Unlike other vegetable vines, they are relatively lightweight even when loaded with fruit so there is less risk of them toppling over. Cucamelons are relatively resistant to pests when compared to similar vining plants.They have a unique crunch and a cucumber-like, slightly tangy flavor, which makes them great for eating raw, for making quick pickles in the refrigerator, as an additive for salsa or salads, or even as a garnish for drinks. Planting instructions: Start the seeds indoors 6 weeks before your last spring frost. Sow the seed in 4-inch pots to give the plants a chance to develop a substantial root system before planting out and to minimize transplant shock. Once the risk of frost has passed, harden off the young plants and move them to the garden. Gardeners in northern regions with unpredictable late-spring weather may wish to protect young plants with cloches or a mini hoop tunnel. Open the ends of the tunnel during the day to regulate temperature and allow air to circulate. I usually leave the mini tunnel in place for 2 to 3 weeks, depending on how quickly summer arrives, then replace it with a trellis. Heat, sun, and rich soil are the keys to growing success with these plants, so pick a site with full sun and amend the soil with aged manure or compost. Seriously consider trellising the plants. We grow ours on sturdy A-frame trellises; this keeps the foliage and fruit off the ground, which minimizes the risk of diseases and makes harvesting a snap. Also, unsupported plants will sprawl in every direction, quickly taking over a garden bed.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61U6nNDSTPL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"NIKA SEEDS","source_asin":"B08K7MSN3F","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-448133","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08K7MSN3F","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08K7MSN3F","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
