window.products.push({"id":448175,"name":"Pillow Protector - Poly-Cotton Blend Pillow Covers - Water and Dust Resistant Pillow Cases - Super Soft and Lightweight Pillow Case Protector for Pill","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.97,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41hMzWc9ppL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"55% Cotton - 45% Polyester Imported THE ULTIMATE PROTECTION: Take your pillow to the next level - Our pillowcase protectors safeguard your pillows from all forms of liquids and stains, as well as discomfort from accumulating on where you rest your head. The protective zippered encasement allows our pillow protectors to prolong the lives of pillows and is highly recommended for all bedding sets to fight off any nighttime problems or to simply maintain a cleaner bed set. SUPREME DURABILITY: Transform your pillow - Our pillow covers offer extremely tough protection with a double stitched hem along the edges with a zippered finish to maintain shape and longevity. Our pillowcase covers are terrific for keeping unwelcome bed bugs and unwanted dust off of your linens, keeping your bedding cozy, inviting, and clean. PREMIUM QUALITY: Give your pillow a makeover - Made of 55% Cotton and 45% polyester, our poly-cotton blend is a prime choice for commercial-grade quality and cleanliness alike. Our pillow protectors were thoughtfully designed and expertly crafted to be durable enough to be used in the hospitality industry or your own home. EASY CARE: Simply machine wash our pillow case covers with warm water (using bleach if necessary) and tumble dry them on the low heat setting. It's that easy! Our bed pillow covers offer comfort, convenience, and function all in one. Our pillowcase is standard size 20\" x 26.\" PACIFIC LINENS: Pacific Linens is your one-stop-shop for home linens, comforter sets, bedsheets, curtain panels, towels, and pillow covers. We are proud to offer the best quality products for you and your family for a comfortable and happy home. Experience the Pacific Linens difference for yourself with one of our premium quality products.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41hMzWc9ppL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Pacific Linens","source_asin":"B01LFPZMEC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-448175","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01LFPZMEC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01LFPZMEC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
