window.products.push({"id":448199,"name":"Bruntmor Bistro Butter Spreaders Set of 4 - Corrossion Resistant Steel","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61SHro8DynL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"A perfect addition to the ever popular Bruntmor Bistro collection, these butter spreaders feature a curved edge that flows to a pointed tip, perfect for slicing into a cube of butter then spreading with elegance. Embrace stylish, modern functionality with the Bruntmor Bistro flatware collection. Bistro is crafted from tarnish-resistant double coated stainless steel with a high-polish mirror finish. Its handles feature rounded sides, slender necks, and gentle flares, capped by slight facets at the tips. Proportions and weight are comfortable, and the working ends have a contemporary style without sacrificing purpose. The Bistro butter spreaders add sleek style to your table. Sold in a set of two, these spreaders are dishwasher safe.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61SHro8DynL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bruntmor","source_asin":"B012B4TOVI","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-448199","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B012B4TOVI","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B012B4TOVI","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
