window.products.push({"id":448344,"name":"MroMax 2PCS Curtain Rod Finial,Plastic Hollow Curtain Rod Pole Decorative End Cap 32mm Inner Diameter Pearl head Ivory White Fit for 32mm Outer Dia Ro","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":10.79,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/517jRd6UdlL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Description:  * These curtain finials made of plastic material, fit for 30mm outer diameter curtain rod. * With retro design, they are good decoration for your home, makes it elegant and fashionable. Suitable for any type of drapery rods, on your living room, bedroom, sliding door and more. * Widely used for the aluminum alloy, wooden and plastic curtain rod.These finials can prevent dust entering to curtain rods. * Tips: Maybe you can use it for smaller rod by wrapping some tape on your rod or inserting some foam inside the cap.  Specification:  * Color: ivory white * Material: Plastic * Fit Rod Outer Dia.(Approx): 30mm / 1.18inch Package Content:  * 2 x Curtain Rod Finials","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/517jRd6UdlL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MroMax","source_asin":"B09GLVG1LB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-448344","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09GLVG1LB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09GLVG1LB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":448345,"name":"Mara Ceramic Stoneware 16 Piece Celestial Odd Shape Dinnerware Set","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":467.83,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51R0f29FplL._AC_.jpg","description":"Listing is for a 16 Piece Odd Shape Dinnerware Set. Mara, an accomplished painter, sculptor and ceramicist, studied engraving with the famous artist Alfredo Zalce, who painted many portraits of his lovely artist protégé. After studying art in London, she began working with high-temperature ceramics and created wonderfully unique glazes for her pieces. She then went on to study with the Italian ceramist, Bruno Terese, in Italy. Mara has had numerous expositions of her original pieces in Europe, the United States and Mexico. \"She has developed a fine sensibility in schematic and precise line drawings. Ceramics is no easy medium for precise line drawings, yet Mara has mastered her technique with brush and stylus and has been able to portray her life experiences with unrivaled naturalness. We see her universe on parade in all of her pieces, whether they be vases or plaques. Flowers, birds and geometric designs all represent her personal vision and display her unique perceptions of the world.\" Alfredo Zalce, May 1994 Sadly, after a long illness, Mara passed away in November 2007. Since Ceramica Mara has always been an extended family operation, production of her fine works has continued. Mara's husband, daughter and loyal apprentices have consistently carried out day to day production. Her husband Mariano, an architect, artist and Ceramica Mara business manager, is passionate about continuing Mara's legacy. Her daughter Alexandra, artist and history professor, has also stepped in to help the family make a seamless transition in the continuation of the fine production of Ceramica Mara.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51R0f29FplL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Mara Ceramic Stoneware","source_asin":"B0089QCFH8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-448345","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0089QCFH8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0089QCFH8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
