window.products.push({"id":448493,"name":"Russbe Lunch Systems, Reusable Snack and Sandwich Bags, Green Pear","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/714Qcct9q2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Reusable, Washable, Durable Just like all Russbe products, our stylish snack and sandwich bags are resilient and reusable. Along with our trendy, fun prints, these bags are durable with reinforced seams and a locking seal to keep your family’s foods fresh. Our gusseted, standup design ensures a mess-free snack/meal experience. And because our nature-friendly bags are completely free of BPA, PVC, latex, and phthalates, you can snack happy, knowing you’re making a healthy choice for you and your on-the-go family. Russbe's locking design is better than velco resuable snack bags since they don't get food stuck in it, and better than blue paper lunch bags because they create less waste. Just fill, wash, and fill again with your favorite snacks! Plus, the exciting design and strong materials makes this product utimately more stylish AND functional than just your average sandwhich bags. What makes resuable plastic baggies so much better? Each RUSSBE bag has the potential to keep hundreds of disposable bags out of the world’s oceans Each RUSSBE bag has the potential to keep hundreds of disposable bags out of the world’s oceans Unlike storebought baggies, RUSSBE are BPA free produce bags Unlike storebought baggies, RUSSBE are BPA free produce bags Kids love colorful zipblock bags with fun designs Kids love colorful zipblock bags with fun designs SAVE MONEY on disposable food bags SAVE MONEY on disposable food bags About RUSSBE Welcome to the Russbe family! We’re a California-based company dedicated to providing fun, waste-free lunch and snack products to you and your family since 2008. Russbe offers convenient, reusable lunch and snack bags and containers to eco-conscious folks and those who want to share our passion for preserving this amazing planet. Each RUSSBE bag has the potential to keep hundreds of disposable bags out of the world’s oceans, cities and landfills while keeping snacks and sandwiches fresh and ready to enjoy. Our new line of Bento boxes are the perfect waste-free solution for packing daily lunches or mid-day snacks for little ones and teens. They’re also great for health-conscious adults who prefer prepping homemade meals and snacks on the go. All Russbe products are durable, easy to use, and simple to clean. They are also free of BPA, PVC, latex and phthalates. Attractively priced and packaged, RUSSBE products allow people to cut back on plastic waste without breaking the bank. Russbe also uses biodegradable and recyclable packaging materials to further reduce the amount of harmful waste. We are dedicated to making a positive difference and maintaining our beautiful planet for generations to come.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/714Qcct9q2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"RUSSBE","source_asin":"B0742S14RL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-448493","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0742S14RL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0742S14RL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
