window.products.push({"id":448496,"name":"HWTONG Cocktail Shaker Set 23-Piece Mixology Bartender Kit, 25oz Stainless Steel Leak-Proof Sturdy Cocktail Shaker Set for Home Bar, Bar Accessories，G","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71yp-HNZLHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【ALL-IN-ONE SET ANSWERS ALL YOUR MIXING NEEDS】 Designed for mixing all kinds of delicious and tasty cocktails, this mixology bartender kit provides all the most essential home bar accessories, one set to meet all your needs of mixing, stirring and shaking. Something extra you need is margarita glasses and booze, then you're ready to go! 【TOP-NOTCH QUALITY FOR LASTED USING】This cocktail shaker set is made of premium 304 stainless steel with the feature of leak-proof, durable, and high abrasion resistance. All bar tools are safe for drinkers and won’t affect the taste. Also, the martini shaker set with a mirror finish craft that is beautiful and lasted to use, both easy on the eyes and wallet. This bar set are dishwasher safe for quick and easy cleaning. 【STORE & DISPLAY YOUR BAR SET WITH STYLISH STAND】Comes with acrylic stand in fashion style, this cocktail shaker set is easy to set up your home bar and your friends will definitely be attracted by this unique modern home decor. The stand is thick, stable, and solid to hold all your bar tools in every slot, so you no longer need to worry about losing cocktail shaker accessories anymore. Keep your bareware organized and accessible. No mess and clutter on your table or drawers anymore. 【PERFECT GIFT FOR PRO & BEGINNER】If you want to make a great gift for one who likes to craft cocktails or other delicious wine on an anniversary, birthday, Father's day, Christmas day, or Valentine's day, then this complete bartender kit with the exquisite box is your perfect choice. The full cocktail set comes with a recipe booklet that included 10+ kinds of cocktails and is designed for not only professional cocktail-mixing gurus but the amateur bartender. GIFT IT! SHARE THE YUMMR RESULTS! 【HIT THE GROUND RUNNING AT HOME & PARTY】Our bar set cocktail shaker set with acrylic stand can be used at home bar or party for cocktails lovers. You're ready to shake whatever you want to drink up with this professional bartender set that included all essentials for your home party.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71yp-HNZLHL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HWTONG","source_asin":"B0C6TV7LWP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-448496","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C6TV7LWP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C6TV7LWP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":448497,"name":"Beemojo Bartender Tool Bag Waxed Canvas Water Resistant Adjustable Shoulder Straps Genuine Leather Handles 16 Pockets Holds 33oz Bottle Mobile Travel ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":44.89,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81kIfnhCeeL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[ Robust, spacious and practical ] Original design in 16oz water resistant waxed cotton canvas, easy-carry top grain genuine leather handles, adjustable removable cotton webbing shoulder straps. Strong secured stitching in straps and handles make it useful for travel catering events and everyday practical use. Impressive amount of space to house 1 litre bottle/cocktail maker/barista flask. 16 specially designed multiple size pockets and elastic loops to securely transport your bar tools. [ Keeps tools safe and secure ] This bag is just fun to use. Simply place your tools in the compartments and roll it. Attach the carrying straps and you’re good to go. Its strong inner lid and high-pressure velcroes will close your bag tight and cover all your contents. When packed, everything has its own space and your items are not overcrowded, thus ensuring protecting the structural integrity of everything. It will hold your kit perfectly and still has enough room for some extras. [Portable quality, easy to use and clean ] Our 16oz Waxed canvas is durable and water resistant - the perfect combination of beauty and durability.The materials feel strong but soft and it’s easy to clean off anything that has dripped on it. You will love the quality and thick material that will keep even your glass items safe. It also boasts its awesome rusty brown color combinations in leather and canvas and shiny metal buckles that will have everyone asking about it! [ The perfect bartender treat ] You can never go wrong with a simple and functional design. Our bag enables you to be the bartender that you are and carry your bartending arsenal no matter where you go. The bag’s design is modern and sophisticated so not only you will keep your stuff organized and easy to find, you will also look cool in a way that will complement you as a dedicated professional bartender and will make every bartending travel/event memorable. [ Sturdy and versatile ] This bag is no doubt fit for a bartender but it also doubles as a bag for everyday use, so if you have other activities in the morning but have bartending at night, this bag is perfect. Its inside compartment will hold a laptop, notebook, stationery and books. It’s also one of the coolest-looking bags out there and will make any bartender feel good to be traveling because it is light, easy to carry and can hold the necessary tools to make cool and delicious drinks.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81kIfnhCeeL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Beemojo","source_asin":"B08NJYS1GD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-448497","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08NJYS1GD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08NJYS1GD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
