window.products.push({"id":448711,"name":"Spectrum Decorative Disinfecting Wipes Container (Satin Nickle) - Refillable Dispenser for Bathroom, Kitchen, Classroom, Countertop, & Home Storage/St","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":22.02,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71v8OGMmxKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Instead of hiding disinfecting wipes in the cabinet, display them proudly in the Decorative Disinfecting Wipes Dispenser from Spectrum. The stylish dispenser features a smooth, rust-resistant finish that looks stunning in any setting, from the kitchen to the living room and the bathroom. Thanks to the innovative design, the Decorative Disinfecting Wipes Dispenser holds both 35-count and 70-count wipe containers. To use the dispenser, simply remove the container’s lid, slide the canister into the dispenser, then feed the wipes through the dispenser lid. The lid contains an easy-to-use wipe dispenser; simply feed the wipes through the dispenser, then pull as needed. When closed, the lid creates an airtight seal, and the simple press of a button opens the dispenser for easy access. A non-slip ring on the base keep the Decorative Disinfecting Wipes Dispenser in place on your kitchen countertop, bathroom vanity, dining room table, or anywhere else you may need them. Allow your cleaning supplies to meld into your home’s décor, ensuring they don’t look out of place when you want to keep them within reach. Made of stainless steel and plastic, this disinfecting wipe dispenser is built to last. To clean, wipe with a damp cloth and towel dry.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71v8OGMmxKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Spectrum Diversified","source_asin":"B0938QVRWY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-448711","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0938QVRWY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0938QVRWY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
