window.products.push({"id":448743,"name":"Cow Print Blanket, Fleece Cow Blanket for Kids Adults, Soft Cow Throw Blanket Cowhide Decor for Couch Sofa Bed (Cow 1, 40x50)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71NyVkTeeFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"No Shedding, No Pilling--- Our cow pint blanket has been proved to not easy to shedding or pilling after more than 10 times washing test. With the new upgraded material, this cow blanket is more softer, no shedding and durable than cotton cow blankets and will not bunch with time like cotton fabric. Perfect Size: this cow blanket has different sizes 40*50/50*60/60*80 inches, ideal cow blanket for kids adults enjoy it in couch, sofa and twin size bed. Black and white cow print blanket also works well with farmhouse decor and leather style accent, it adds extra texture to your home decor with the simple yet classy cow element design. Your Best Companion Anywhere: Enjoy your leisure time with Auivty flannel cow blankets and throws * Surround yourself while watching TV on the chair or couch at chilly nights * Having a comfy nap in your work with our super cozy cow blanket * Taking it along with your short trips * Suitable for outdoor activities like camping, backpacking or travel. * In addition, your little pet will also love this cow stuff too. Very Popular Cow Element * Many people like cow stuffs such as cow bed blankets, cow throw blanket, cow bedding, cow mats,cowhide blanket and other black and white holstein cow pattern stuffs. It also liked by people who like farmhouse decor or leather accent decor. * Yes, Use it in bed blanket, sofa blanket/couch blanket, nap blanket, pets blanket, air-conditional blanket, it will be the most unique scenery of your room ! you can also use it all year round. Satisfaction Guaranteed:The cow print blanket is vacuum packed, when you received the package, please wash it once to air dry for a period of time, the cow blanket will become fluffy. We offer 60-days return and replacement service & life-time free customer service. If you not satisfied with this blanket, please contact us immediately with no hesitate.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71NyVkTeeFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AUIVTY","source_asin":"B09DX6YWYH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-448743","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09DX6YWYH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09DX6YWYH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
