window.products.push({"id":448795,"name":"VOTOWN HOME Sherpa Blanket Twin Extra Soft Plush Blanket Cozy Warm Reversible Winter Blanket for Bedroom Micro Fleece Fabric, Living Coral Twin Size 6","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61F87eIJ9rL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Material】Dual Sided Super Soft Blanket is made of a soft flannel face and a plush Sherpa. The front is smooth fleece(220gsm)and the back is a shaggy, white, fluffy sherpa material(260gsm). It feels like lying on pure wool and making it the perfect accent for any bed, sofa or chair. This blanket is anti-pilling, wrinkle free, hypoallergenic, and does not shed. 【Size& Colors】It comes in 12 different colors and is available in 2 sizes. Votown Plush Winter blanket have size in 50\" x 60\" inches and Twin Size 60\"x80\" inches, which big enough to covers your whole body and will keep you warm all winter long. The warmth and softness of a fleece winter blanket can help soothe you to sleep and keep you sleeping more comfortably throughout a cold night. 【Multi Usage Scenarios】Votown flannel fleece blankets are ideal for indoor and outdoor. Using soft and smooth material, not too thin, you feel really warm when you put in on. They are especially popular with children. Fleece is good at wicking away moisture, another benefit when used on a child’s bed. Also It’s perfect for lazy Sundays, sick days, or even movie nights with the whole family. 【Attractive Gift Package】Our blankets make awesome gifts for mother, sister, aunt, teacher, wife , best friend or whole family. Also it’s Perfect choice for holidays gift, Mother Day's Gift, Thanksgiving gift, Christmas gift. 【Care Instruction】Easy care fabric with minimal shrinkage. To ensure years of cozy comfort, wash the blanket in mild detergent and cool or lukewarm water with similar colors. Do not wash or dry with towels, sweaters or other fabrics that might pill or get fibers caught in the Sherpa fabric.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61F87eIJ9rL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"VOTOWN HOME","source_asin":"B07R71WCBY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-448795","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07R71WCBY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07R71WCBY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":448796,"name":"Kitchen Utensils Set - 8 Silicone Cooking Utensils Stainless Steel Handle-Tongs, Spoon, Pasta Server, Ladle, Strainer, Metal Whisk and 2 Spatulas","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71LMtVrNp1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Your search is over for the best silicone and stainless steel kitchen utensil set! Please consider this 8 piece set by Kitchen Stuff & Beyond . Being a professional cook or just learning to boil water, these utensils are just what you need. Made of silicone tips and stainless steel handles, these utensils can withstand temperatures up to 480 degrees. The handles are so strong you won’t worry about them bending as you cook. We’ve included 8 pieces that we feel will make your cooking time easier and quicker. Flex Spatula for smoothing icing and cleaning out the last little bit in a jar Serving Spoon for when you need a big spoon that can take the heat Turner Spatula for flipping eggs and meat Deep Ladle for dipping out your delicious soup and chili Pasta Server for serving your yummy spaghetti Handheld Strainer for getting out food without the liquid Tong for grabbing meat or vegetables. And it locks to keep it closed during storage Whisk for mixing eggs and pancake mix. And it has 2 stages for better mixing These utensils can be used as a GIFT and in RV’s, restaurants, homes, schools, churches, delis, food trucks, BBQ’s and any place food is prepared. These utensils were specially manufactured not to come apart, melt or hold water in the handles. Others might but these don't. Our silicone and stainless steel utensils are backed by a 100% satisfaction guarantee. Now scroll up to the ADD to CART button and make these beautiful and practical kitchen utensils yours!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71LMtVrNp1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kitchen Stuff & Beyond","source_asin":"B0791TM8Y8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-448796","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0791TM8Y8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0791TM8Y8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
