window.products.push({"id":448818,"name":"Courtney's Candles Mahogany Teakwood Maximum Scented 16oz Jar Candle","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":21.4,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31PYVltZO2L._AC_.jpg","description":"MAHOGANY TEAKWOOD - Courtneys Candles Maximum Scented 16oz Large Jar Candle - Burns 140 HoursMAHOGANY TEAKWOOD - Delightful blend of mahogany, teakwood & oak with a touch of floral lavender.Courtneys Candles’ Maximum Scented 26oz Large Jar Candles contain twice the fragrance of other major brands and have a long burn time of around 200 Hours. Our family has been making great scented jar candles since 1992 and the little girl on the label is our daughter, Courtney, at age 7.We’ve always put as much fragrance as possible into every one of our jar candles and then added a little bit more so many of our Scented Jar Candles have little liquid scent pockets that you can see thru the glass! Every 26 oz jar candle burns evenly all the way to the bottom, contains around a pound and a half of scented wax, and fits all major brands of candle warmers.Try just one and you’ll be hooked for life!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31PYVltZO2L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Courtney's Candles","source_asin":"B01FMPX3CE","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-448818","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01FMPX3CE","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01FMPX3CE","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
