window.products.push({"id":448846,"name":"Bamber Large Stainless Steel Baking Sheets Set of 3 Cookie Sheet Pan Baking Pans Roasting Tray,13.6x17.5x1.9 Inches","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":28.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71v2JrpJLnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Non-toxic: The baking sheets are made by food grade heavy duty stainless steel without any coating. This material is dishwasher safe. It will never rust and should last for a lifetime in terms of durability. It is also safe in daily use no mater for baking, roasting or food serving. Large Set of 3: The cookie pans come with 3 packs in total. Each of them measures 13.6x17.5 inches (34.5X44.5CM). The available area is definitely large enough for your purpose. Elaborate Design: You can also find many a considerate design in our roasting trays, including smooth roll edge, smooth round corner, mirror finished surface, as well as the groove for catching drippings from broiling foods. All these designs make cleanup a breeze, make the pan easy to wash by hand and dishwasher safe to save your time. Multi Function: Our baking pan is perfect for baking cookies, meat, vegetables, pizza, pastry or any other food in your mind. These baking trays also work well as serving trays for fruit, cookies, snacks. Sustainable and Durable: Our stainless steel cookie sheet set features solid construction. They feel strong and sturdy when holding in your hands. They have a nice weight to cook. With high hardness, you have no worries about distortion, bending issues.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71v2JrpJLnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bamber","source_asin":"B09YXY8MRR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-448846","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09YXY8MRR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09YXY8MRR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":448847,"name":"Smart Christmas Tree Lights - 6FT Handmade Spiral Christmas Tree with 138 LED Lights and Christmas Tree Topper Star, Remote&App, Music Sync&Timer Cont","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":79.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71LPMLaegaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[🎄 Christmas Decoration 2023 Version] - 6 ft Smart Christmas Tree with Star Finial present the Christmas tree shape for festival decoration. With 138 RGB multicolor LED lights including red, green, blue, yellow and pink, shining and twinkling to give you a colorful holiday environment. Decor your home with this impressive lighting effect to impress your guests. [📦Portable and Easy to Set Up] - DiamondTiger outdoor Christmas tree with lights and topper can be folded and fit into a small box, so it can be easily stored and used again for many years. These Christmas tree lights also connect with Bluetooth, connected to the smart phone automatically and easily. [🌈Amazing Light Effects] - With the IC tech, DiamondTiger christmas tree lightshow lights allows each light on the whole tree light to display different colors simultaneously and brighter than traditional christmas string lights. You can DIY the lights pattern and flowing effects, you can even arrange the lights to make text. The fun is only limited by your imagination. [🎵 Sync with Music] - This pencil christmas tree has built-in microphone that will sync with any music and sound. This artificial christmas tree lights will \"dance\" with the beats of music. This function is available on the “Hello Fairy” App and the included remote controller. Try it and enjoy the entertainment experience. [🌟Christmas Tree Topper] - Unlike other outside Christmas tree products, you need to purchase an extra tree topper. A color changing smart LED Christmas tree topper is included with this spiral christmas trees for outside. It is truly one purchase to fulfill all your Christmas tree decoration needs. Combine it with your favorite ornaments, you will be ready for your wonderful holiday season.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71LPMLaegaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DiamondTiger","source_asin":"B0BK9T2GYH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-448847","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BK9T2GYH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BK9T2GYH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":448848,"name":"Sumnacon Set of 3 Adjustable Curtain Drapery Rod Bracket Holders for 1 Inch Rods, Extendable Wall-Mounted Metal Single Rod Bracket - Black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61s8HtWtb0L._AC_SL1024_.jpg","description":"Description: It’s a perfect solution for curtain drapery rod bracket holder.They are made of high quality material, can remain secure while supporting heavy drapes.It’s easy to install, work perfectly for curtains, drapes, layering or extending over blinds. Easy installation and comes with 6 matching screws and anchors provide everything you need to install a lasting and durable fixture for your walls and windows.These rod brackets hooks adjust to accommodate a maximum rod diameter of 3/4 or 5/8 inches while the horizontal frame extends from 3.5 to 4.5 inches from the wall.Adapt versatility offered by adjustable components serves effectively in a variety of different indoor scenarios. SPECIFICATIONS Material:SteelColor:Black Package Includes 3 x Rod brackets with Screws","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61s8HtWtb0L._AC_SL1024_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sumnacon","source_asin":"B07N4HLBRS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-448848","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07N4HLBRS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07N4HLBRS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
