window.products.push({"id":448913,"name":"Qlife Q-Cup Touch Hydrogen Water Generator Maker | SPE/PEM Membrane Technology | High Grade Titanium Plates | Japan Technology Portable Molecular Hydr","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41WszB6uruL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Q-Cup TOUCH is a new released Molecular Hydrogen Water Generator by Qlife. It is designed specifically to infuse and generate hydrogen in any drinkable water. A Touch of a button will infuse the water with enriched hydrogen which help our bodies fight free radicals. The Q-Cup Touch is the smallest and lightest hydrogen water generator that weighs only 150 grams, even lighter than the previous generation. It's easily taken anywhere and connects to any plastic water bottles. Product Features: Turn any drinking water into hydrogen-rich water instantly. Turn any drinking water into hydrogen-rich water instantly. Portable and Easy to Use Portable and Easy to Use 3.5 mins ONLY on Hydrogen Water Generation 3.5 mins ONLY on Hydrogen Water Generation Produce up to 1300 ppb of H2 concentration Produce up to 1300 ppb of H2 concentration Japanese SPE/PEM membrane Technology (No ozone or Chlorine) Japanese SPE/PEM membrane Technology (No ozone or Chlorine) 2nd Gen. DSC Touch panel module – Complete touch sensors 2nd Gen. DSC Touch panel module – Complete touch sensors One-Piece Body Construction – More Durable One-Piece Body Construction – More Durable TRITAN Flask material (BPA Free) TRITAN Flask material (BPA Free) Electrodes Disinfectant Cleaning System (EDC). Electrodes Disinfectant Cleaning System (EDC). High grade Titanium + Platinum coating Electrodes High grade Titanium + Platinum coating Electrodes 2 X Quality Rechargeable Lithium Polymer Batteries 2 X Quality Rechargeable Lithium Polymer Batteries Up to 30 Cycles of Hydrogen Generation on a full charge. Up to 30 Cycles of Hydrogen Generation on a full charge. With the latest Japanese Electrode technology providing your drinking water with the perfect combination of molecular hydrogen & rejuvenation properties for your body. (up to 1300 ppb of H2 concentration on a single Touch & more than 1500 ppb H2 on multiple times generations). Using the latest Japanese membrane technology, combined with the built-in waste gas escape valve, successive chlorine & ozone gas is removed making your hydrogen water 100% more purer and safer than older hydrogen technologies. It is also exclusively designed with an EDC cleaning system. By adding a pinch of salt to make sterilizing water which can be used as an organic cleanser.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41WszB6uruL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Qlife","source_asin":"B082K9FQR7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-448913","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B082K9FQR7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B082K9FQR7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
