window.products.push({"id":448975,"name":"Sophia's Kitchen Kids Baking Set -30- Pcs Unicorn Kids Baking Set with Real Baking Tools, Baking for kids, Cookie Cutters, kids chef hat & apron, muff","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":24.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51W6wUiP49L._AC_.jpg","description":"At Sophia’s Kitchen, our mission is to help contribute to a happy childhood for kids around the world by providing fun and practical accessories made with high attention to detail. We work only with safe, top-quality materials and child-friendly designs to deliver lovely childrens baking set with real supplies and utensils that provide countless possibilities to learn new things and introduce kids to the beautiful world of baking! Should you not be entirely pleased with your purchase, our customer care department is at your disposal and will address any issues or concerns! Unicorn Kids Baking Set – Encourage Your Little Chef to Harness His Skills This kids baking sets for teens set provides a great opportunity to help your kiddo learn new and fun things about baking while stimulating his/her creativity and fine motor skills. Baking with real utensils and kids baking supplies provides kids with an authentic baking experience in a way that it’s accessible and comfortable for them, but also very fun. The kid baking set includes all the baking utensils your kids need to join you for a baking session such as an apron, a bonnet, whisk, cookie cutters, a mitt and so much more, all in a cute unicorn-themed design that your little one will simply adore! Still not convinced? Here are some of the amazing features of this product: 30-pcs kids baking kit; Adorable unicorn theme; High-quality materials; Safe for kids; Non-toxic and food-grade; Easy to use; Real utensils for a genuinebaking experience; Can help stimulate attention, focus, math skills, vocabulary, and fine motor skills; May help improve social skills and promote teamwork; Can help boost self-confidence; Promotes healthy eating and encourages family bonding; Thoughtful gift for kids; Your little one will love this baking set!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51W6wUiP49L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sophia's Kitchen","source_asin":"B0BLMM1D15","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-448975","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BLMM1D15","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BLMM1D15","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
